  catches a tagged exception rooted at ArgumentError
  catches DuplicateFieldError through its ContractViolation superclass
  catches a tagged exception rooted at StandardError
  registry errors
    still descend from StandardError
    are all catchable as Axn::Error
    have no Axn::Internal constant in their ancestry

